is gitignored (.gitignore:4 "tmp/"). The live server on :8080 was not
contacted, restarted or rebuilt over.

BOTTOM LINE: 6 of 7 criteria met with cited evidence. Criterion 7 fails on a
single, mechanically demonstrated, one-command defect: web/static/css/
tailwind.css was never regenerated, so the template's focus-ring and
reduced-motion classes have no CSS rules and `make css-verify` exits 2.
